(text "VIO_ADC = VIO x 22 / 122. Long ADC acquisition time required.\nDesign use: regulated 5 V logic supply; selected VIO 4.5-14 V.\nExternal pins must stay between GND and selected VIO.\nApply 5 V logic power before external VIO or driven I/O signals.\nInput/output terminals have NO series resistors." (at 20 222 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top) ) (uuid "7b19900f-22e7-4768-8e96-d70c47b2a593"))
